.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-TRUST-ROOT-BOOTSTRAP 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-trust\-root\-bootstrap \- Enroll the first verifier key with its signed challenge
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu trust\-root bootstrap\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-verifier\fR] [\fB\-\-public\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-pop\-signature\fR] [\fB\-\-attests\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enroll the first verifier key with its signed challenge
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-verifier\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Verifier identifier for a signed statement
.TP
\fB\-\-public\-key\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Verifier public key
.TP
\fB\-\-pop\-signature\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Proof\-of\-possession signature
.TP
\fB\-\-attests\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
IRI of the object being attested
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
